oid crashes when the OS tears down camera resources.\r\n- Refresh camera metadata and recompute feed rotation using the app’s reported orientation so front/back cameras stay correctly aligned after configuration changes.\r\n- Forward Android configuration orientation updates through `GodotLib.onScreenRotationChange()` and guard image callbacks with a mutex to keep metadata refresh and frame delivery synchronized.\r\n\r\nI wanted to split the rotation handling and lifecycle event handling, but both rely on refresh_camera_metadata(), so I couldn’t separate them.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nThis PR provides the following benefits:\r\n\r\n- Prevents camera preview crashes when auto-rotation is enabled.\r\n- Temporarily suspends camera functionality when the app is suspended to reduce battery consumption.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/m